# CommonsBase_FileMagic

## Overview

The OpenBSD `file`(1) content-type identifier, built for every dk ABI as a single self-contained executable with the magic database compiled in.

`CommonsBase_FileMagic` repackages the OpenBSD 7.8 `file`(1)/libmagic
sources and overlays selected upstream `file/file` FILE5_47 magic entries,
adding Diskuv-authored compatibility shims so the tool builds and runs
identically across the macOS, Linux, and Windows ABIs. Every ABI produces
one `bin/file` with the magic database compiled in, so there is no separate
`magic` database to ship or locate at runtime.

